{
  "version": "Notebook/1.0",
  "items": [
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "# 🛡️ Governança de Tokens — Demo E2E Agentic (APIM no meio)\n\nTelemetria emitida pelo **API Management** (`apim-zj44ehcf4zlxq`) via policy `azure-openai-emit-token-metric`.\nCada chamada do agente ao modelo passa pelo APIM e fica registada aqui, **por consumidor**.\n\n> Fonte: App Insights `insights-zj44ehcf4zlxq` · Métricas: Total/Prompt/Completion Tokens · Dimensões: Consumer, Model, Region."
      },
      "name": "titulo"
    },
    {
      "type": 9,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "id": "timeRange",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "TimeRange",
            "label": "Intervalo",
            "type": 4,
            "value": { "durationMs": 2592000000 },
            "typeSettings": {
              "selectableValues": [
                { "durationMs": 3600000 },
                { "durationMs": 86400000 },
                { "durationMs": 604800000 },
                { "durationMs": 2592000000 }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "style": "pills"
      },
      "name": "parametros"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "customMetrics\n| where name == \"Total Tokens\"\n| summarize ['Total Tokens'] = sum(value)",
        "size": 4,
        "title": "Total de Tokens (intervalo selecionado)",
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.insights/components",
        "visualization": "tiles"
      },
      "name": "tile-total-tokens"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "customMetrics\n| where name == \"Total Tokens\"\n| extend Consumer = tostring(customDimensions[\"Consumer\"])\n| summarize TotalTokens = sum(value) by Consumer\n| order by TotalTokens desc",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "Tokens por Consumidor",
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.insights/components",
        "visualization": "barchart"
      },
      "name": "tokens-por-consumidor"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "customMetrics\n| where name in (\"Prompt Tokens\", \"Completion Tokens\", \"Total Tokens\")\n| extend Consumer = tostring(customDimensions[\"Consumer\"])\n| summarize Tokens = sum(value) by Consumer, name\n| evaluate pivot(name, sum(Tokens))\n| order by ['Total Tokens'] desc",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "Prompt vs Completion por Consumidor",
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.insights/components",
        "visualization": "table"
      },
      "name": "prompt-vs-completion"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "customMetrics\n| where name == \"Total Tokens\"\n| extend Consumer = tostring(customDimensions[\"Consumer\"])\n| summarize Tokens = sum(value) by bin(timestamp, 1h), Consumer\n| render timechart",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "Consumo de Tokens no Tempo",
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.insights/components",
        "visualization": "timechart"
      },
      "name": "tokens-no-tempo"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "customMetrics\n| where name == \"Total Tokens\"\n| extend Model = tostring(customDimensions[\"Model\"])\n| summarize TotalTokens = sum(value) by Model\n| order by TotalTokens desc",
        "size": 1,
        "title": "Tokens por Modelo",
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.insights/components",
        "visualization": "piechart"
      },
      "name": "tokens-por-modelo"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "requests\n| summarize Total = count() by resultCode\n| extend Resultado = case(resultCode == \"429\", \"429 — rate limit (TPM)\", resultCode == \"403\", \"403 — quota excedida\", resultCode startswith \"2\", \"2xx — OK\", strcat(resultCode, \" — outro\"))\n| project Resultado, Total\n| order by Total desc",
        "size": 1,
        "title": "Resultados HTTP no APIM (429 = governança a atuar)",
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.insights/components",
        "visualization": "table"
      },
      "name": "taxa-429"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "requests\n| summarize p50 = percentile(duration, 50), p95 = percentile(duration, 95), p99 = percentile(duration, 99) by bin(timestamp, 1h)\n| render timechart",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "Latência do APIM (p50/p95/p99 ms)",
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.insights/components",
        "visualization": "timechart"
      },
      "name": "latencia"
    }
  ],
  "$schema": "https://github.com/Microsoft/Application-Insights-Workbooks/blob/master/schema/workbook.json"
}
